 with the same diff card the Pomodoro blocks [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]use.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]sub_bullet_task_block_preview.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/sub_bullet_task_block_preview.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-3i[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-3i/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Emit batch-level task_blocks from bob capture[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]task_blocks_contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]task_blocks_contract: move the Pomodoro block diff helpers into a shared[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]module, add a batch-level parent-task tracker fed by sub-bullet items, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and emit the additive top-level `task_blocks` JSON (final-state block, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cumulative diff against the note before the capture). Add unit and CLI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests and the docs/capture.md contract. Pomodoro block JSON stays [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]byte-identical.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Decode and present task blocks in CaptureCore[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac_task_block_model[dim] · [dim][/dim]after task_blocks_contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac_task_block_model: in bob-mac-capture, add tolerant `task_blocks` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decoding, a shared diff-row model, task-row tokenizing (tags and block [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]IDs), a pure CaptureTaskBlockPresentation (caption, status, rows, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]folding of long quiet runs, covers rule, accessibility), and sub-bullet [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wording. Add real-bob fixtures and CaptureCore tests. Commit and get [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]macOS CI green.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render the parent task card in the preview pane[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac_task_block_view[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac_task_block_model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac_task_block_view: extract a shared BlockDiffCard from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]PomodoroBlockView, add TaskBlockView (status caption, status rail, diff [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gutter, indent guides, task tinting, expandable folds), render task [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]blocks after the items, give covered sub-bullet items a compact header, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]name the parent in the status and summary, and fix the stale \"Preview [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]failed\" footer. Add fake-bob routes, model, height, and render tests, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the README, and green macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-3i","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-3i.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-08468da1c75ee3bbebe4477372e89197","started_at":"2026-10-02T13:52:28.507638+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[{"committed_at":1790955995,"sha":"0791fb6ae5d1767110854a9481c6501af8613246","subject":"fix(capture): preserve first-touch order in task block output"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"4a338cd1a854bc63663245f581aa5e0e1f72a89f3b3a53a200ca42b1a506b1bc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cl